{"speciesId":585,"names":{"fr":"Vivaldaim","es":"Deerling","en":"Deerling","ja":"シキジカ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son pelage prend la même couleur et la même odeur que les hautes herbes. S’il sent un ennemi, il court s’y réfugier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The color and scent of their fur changes to match the mountain grass. When they sense hostility, they hide in the grass."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand la saison change, il change de pelage et d’odeur. Un Pokémon qui annonce le passage des saisons."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Their coloring changes according to the seasons and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Their coloring changes according to the seasons and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son pelage change selon la saison, et dans une moindre mesure en fonction de l’humidité et de la température."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"El color de su cuerpo cambia no solo con las estaciones, sino también con los cambios de humedad y temperatura."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Their coloring changes according to the seasons and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"季節が 変わったとき だけでなく 気温や 湿度に よっても 体の色は 少し 変化する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand la saison change, il change de pelage et d’odeur. Un Pokémon qui annonce le passage des saisons."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Durante los cambios de estación, su pelaje y olor cambian. Esto anuncia el comienzo de una estación."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"季節の 変わり目に なると 体毛と においが 変化する。 季節を 告げる ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son pelage change selon la saison, et dans une moindre mesure en fonction de l’humidité et de la température."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El color de su cuerpo cambia no solo con las estaciones, sino también con los cambios de humedad y temperatura."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Their coloring changes according to the seasons and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"季節が 変わったとき だけでなく 気温や 湿度に よっても 体の色は 少し 変化する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand la saison change, il change de pelage et d’odeur. Un Pokémon qui annonce le passage des saisons."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Durante los cambios de estación, su pelaje y olor cambian. Esto anuncia el comienzo de una estación."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"季節の 変わり目に なると 体毛と においが 変化する。 季節を 告げる ポケモン。"}],"varieties":[{"id":585,"moves":[{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[11,"level-up",10],[14,"level-up",10],[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[25,"level-up",10]]},{"name":"jump-kick","learns":[[11,"level-up",24],[14,"level-up",24],[15,"level-up",24],[16,"level-up",24],[17,"level-up",24],[18,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[25,"level-up",7]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[18,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[2